1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,764
Five things you must do in India.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:08,051
Do drink chai and eat vada pav on the street, for about twenty cents.

3
00:00:09,051 --> 00:00:13,453
Do ride an overnight sleeper train, along with twenty-three million passengers every day.

4
00:00:14,453 --> 00:00:18,500
Do see the Taj Mahal at sunrise, but never on a Friday, when it is closed.

5
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:25,397
Do watch the Ganga Aarti in Varanasi, where priests wave fire lamps at the river every evening, for free.

6
00:00:26,397 --> 00:00:33,061
Do hike down to the living root bridges in Meghalaya, grown from tree roots, with a double-decker about two hundred years old.

